摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Agent-led audio production toolkit: sampled instruments, timeline-based arranging, sound effects, TTS, multitrack mixing, and video muxing.","id":"gh:1436514499","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"any-audio","slug":"cloudoyx/any-audio","topics":["ai-audio","animation-audio","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","music-generation","sound-effects","soundfont","text-to-speech"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Agent-led audio production toolkit: sampled instruments, timeline-based arranging, sound effects, TT"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"S, multitrack mixing, and video muxing."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Hear the difference · Install · Sound sources · Speech TTS · 中文说明"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"AnyAudio is an audio production toolkit for AI agents. It turns a sound idea into an actual audio pr"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"oject: write notes and render real instruments, write lines and generate speech, drop in sound effec"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ts, arrange the structure, and mix the multitrack result. Video soundtracks are just one use — scene"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"s, sound design, standalone music, audiobooks, podcasts and game audio all come out of the same pipe"},{"id":"p3s5","text":"und design, standalone music, audiobooks, podcasts and game audio all come out of the same pipeline."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The agent keeps the creative decisions. AnyAudio supplies the tools and execution needed to turn a s"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ound idea into a finished audio file."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it solves"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Models can already write code that makes sound, but it rarely sounds like an instrument, a recording"},{"id":"p6s2","text":", or a finished mix. AnyAudio fills that gap:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Real instrument timbres** — rendered from local sample banks instead of hand-written oscillators"},{"id":"p7s2","text":".\n- **Notes land directly on the timeline** — millisecond accuracy; music, narration and effects sha"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"re one clock.\n- **Automatic mix balance** — tracks are placed in order with per-track gain, pan and "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"fades; declaring a track as `narration` makes the plugin duck the other buses under the voice, and t"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"he master is peak-normalised so the whole mix does not clip.\n- **Effects and voices** — sound effect"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"s either sampled from the installed banks or generated procedurally, plus speech through Edge TTS an"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"d MiMo-V2.5-TTS (currently free)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Hear the difference"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Both pairs contain identical material: one version made without the plugin, one with it. Listen firs"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"t, read the numbers after."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> GitHub plays embedded videos muted by default — click the speaker icon in the player to hear the a"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"Hub plays embedded videos muted by default — click the speaker icon in the player to hear the audio."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### \"Fly Me to the Moon\", bossa nova: arranged and adapted by the agent"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The same 57-second bossa nova. Version A was produced the way an agent works without AnyAudio, writi"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ng NumPy synthesis directly; version B was rendered by AnyAudio from local sample banks. Same arrang"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ement, only the sound source changed."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| | Version A — without AnyAudio | Version B — with AnyAudio |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Peak / average level | -1.5 dBFS / -19.9 dB | -1.5 dBFS / -20.8 dB |\n| Crest factor | 18.4 dB | 19"},{"id":"p14s2","text":".3 dB |\n| Spectral centroid | 1,356 Hz | 1,890 Hz |\n| Energy above 4 kHz | 6.8% | 11.6% |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Music version A — waveform and spectrogramMusic version B — waveform and spectrogramhttps://github.c"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"om/user-attachments/assets/9f496f67-0bd7-496e-96d9-4c2ccb4a28ebhttps://github.com/user-attachments/a"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ssets/86ac18e0-f530-452b-9711-7f7471855b80"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Version B uses sampled instruments: it sounds more like real players, with more high-frequency detai"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"l and more dynamic headroom."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### A rainy night in five lines: speech and sound effects"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The same 24-second scene, five lines of dialogue, plus rain, footsteps and a door, produced twice. L"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ines and timing are identical."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| | Version A — without AnyAudio | Version B — with AnyAudio |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Peak / average level | -1.5 dBFS / -27.5 dB | -1.5 dBFS / -26.1 dB |\n| Crest factor | 26.0 dB | 24"},{"id":"p20s2","text":".6 dB |\n| Spectral centroid | 5,629 Hz | 4,401 Hz |\n| Energy above 4 kHz | 55.3% | 44.0% |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Speech and effects version A — waveform and spectrogramSpeech and effects version B — waveform and s"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"pectrogramhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c4ae1a17-d7bc-4db1-b96a-be244fd75358https://git"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"hub.com/user-attachments/assets/4fca1c9e-b373-4ab7-b18b-afe3e81ad102"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Version B's voices match the emotion and pacing of the scene more closely, and its effects are more "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"realistic and more detailed."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Node.js 22.19+ (22.x) or 24+ (bundled with DSH); ffmpeg is only needed for speech and for muxing vid"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"e.js 22.19+ (22.x) or 24+ (bundled with DSH); ffmpeg is only needed for speech and for muxing video."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"If DSH boots a different profile, replace `desktop` with that profile name. Restart DSH once after i"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"nstalling so it picks up the plugin."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Then open the **AnyAudio** page in DSH Settings to install a sound source (GeneralUser GS is the def"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ault suggestion), switch the speech engine and adjust mixing defaults. No SoundFont is bundled with "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ion), switch the speech engine and adjust mixing defaults. No SoundFont is bundled with the package."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### From source"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"For local development, install from a clone instead of the registry:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The path must be absolute (on Windows, `D:/any-audio` style), and DSH needs a restart once after add"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ing it. `npm run font` downloads both suggested banks (about 72 MB) into the shared sound library, w"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"hich is handy when you want the banks ready before opening Settings."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"A clone also gives you the headless renderer, useful for iterating on a score without an agent:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Describe the work as usual while generating a video; the agent calls the plugin to render audio on i"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"e the work as usual while generating a video; the agent calls the plugin to render audio on its own:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"> Make a 30-second ink-wash animation: a seed in a rock crevice grows into a sapling. Add a little C"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"hinese-style music and wind, no narration."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"You can adjust musical detail and mixing behaviour as you go:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"> Guzheng lead, strings bed, cello on the low end; pull the music down whenever a voice comes in."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"For a song, state the brief and call it directly:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"> Write me a Japanese RPG battle theme, loopable, 30 to 60 seconds. Drums, electric guitar and strin"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"rite me a Japanese RPG battle theme, loopable, 30 to 60 seconds. Drums, electric guitar and strings."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- **SoundFont only** — no SFZ, Kontakt or VST; converting other source formats is out of scope for t"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"his version.\n- **No per-note envelope control** — attack and release come from the preset; use short"},{"id":"p43s3","text":" notes with gaps for staccato and velocity plus expression for dynamics.\n- **Chinese instruments are"},{"id":"p43s4","text":" GM approximations** — `guzheng` maps to Koto, `dizi` to Flute, `erhu` to Fiddle; dedicated banks wi"},{"id":"p43s5","text":"tions** — `guzheng` maps to Koto, `dizi` to Flute, `erhu` to Fiddle; dedicated banks will do better."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
